!!!Need to create Armor, Item, and Weapon class.!!!

If creating a file/folder for each item of code.
Remember to double check the folders and files you want to reference with C#
are in the same folder as the Project.
For example in this:
I accidentally put the Items. Characters, Armor, Stats, and Weapons in folders,
but they were in the root folder of the project, not within the CharacterCreation folder.
So make sure to put them in the main Project Folder, and not within the root of the project.
This makes it so they are all within the same namespace and can easily be referenced.

The code, as basic as it is, works right now. Although it doesn't do much besides read out the 
Strength of each type of Characeter.

